OL,3,GNEWSAMPs call for help for threatened  
OL,4,Agas storage site                       
OL,6,FTwo MPs are calling on the government  
OL,7,Fto step in to save an East Yorkshire   
OL,8,Fgas storage facility threatened with   
OL,9,Fclosure.                               
OL,11,FEnergy firm SSE said the process for a 
OL,12,Fgradual reduction in storage capacity  
OL,13,Fat the Atwick facility, near Hornsea,  
OL,14,Fwas expected to begin next summer, but 
OL,15,Fno firm decision had been made.        
OL,17,FConservative MPs Graham Stuart and     
OL,18,FCharlie Dewhirst met with the firm on  
OL,19,FMonday to try to get the decision      
OL,20,Freversed.                              
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
